Partially implemented

- Schema validation
  - Basic schema reporting exists.
  - Full datatype validation and renamed-column detection are not complete.
  - API configuration is not fully forwarded.

- Business-rule validation
  - Basic rules such as `>= 0` and `contains @` exist.
  - A complete configurable rule engine is not implemented.

- Forecasting
  - Linear and ARIMA forecasting work.
  - Prophet and LSTM currently fall back because optional runtimes are unavailable.

- Explainable AI
  - Feature importance and SHAP support exist.
  - A complete interactive XAI dashboard is not implemented.

- Generative AI summaries
  - Basic AI-style summaries exist.
  - Full report-generation workflows and executive report automation are missing.

## Implemented

- Exact duplicate detection
- Data quality analysis
- Drift detection
- Trend analysis
- ARIMA and linear forecasting
- Feature importance
- Optional SHAP explanations
- Multi-source loading
